// What the most one frame of each screen's opening does on a workspace of real size (real_size_wbtest.mbt), by window
// and screen: nodes of the window's tree made, laid out, words measured. Each the bar it may only fall from: one more
// than a tenth over it fails, and one more than a tenth under it until it is brought down here (the lines to write are
// printed by the test). Counted 2026-11-11 on the values of client/core-ts/test/real-size.ts; the chats' screens and
// those a mode puts a sheet or panel up on counted again that day, once the workspace was held as a device holds it (a
// chat asked `compact`, the sheet or panel reading the real values too).

// Raised once, 2026-11-15: a wide station's page's overview holds its terminals' 打开终端 row (sfpages
// station_terminals_node.mbt), a row of a new thing it shows, not more done for what it showed before.
// Again that day, a wide chat's screens: its side panel's bar made as nodes (sfdesk panel_bar_node.mbt), what its old
// view built as it opened now made, laid out and measured by the window's tree, nothing more shown.
// Raised once, 2026-11-15: files-clash's dialog (sfdesk drag.mbt) made as nodes of the window's tree, what the old
// view built of it before (and measured as it drew) now made and measured in the tree's count.
// Again that day, a phone's film and song in the viewer: its player made as nodes (sf player_node.mbt), what its old
// view built as it opened now made, laid out and measured by the window's tree, nothing more shown.
// Raised once, 2026-11-15: the wide stations' place made as nodes (sfdesk places.mbt stations_place_node), the station
// picked in it the same page as wide settings-station's, what its old view built now made in the tree's count.
// Lowered 2026-11-16, the wide window's: what the changes of one moment owe of what is under the pointer and what a
// still pointer is over settled once as of it (mbui's Tree::withins_owed_now), not laid out again for each change.
// Raised once, 2026-11-16: a new chat's model panel (sfpages model_triple.mbt): its body and foot made as nodes, what its
// old view built as it opened now made, laid out and measured by the window's tree, nothing more shown; what the old
